# A computed percentile outside 0 to 100 is DS4004 when the query runs.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize p = percentile(amount, 100 + 50)
---- expected
error[DS4004]: percentile 150 is outside 0 to 100
  --> query:2:17
  |
2 | | summarize p = percentile(amount, 100 + 50)
  |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ in this call of `percentile`
  |
  = note: the second argument of `percentile` is a percentage from 0 to 100
